      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Portraius Studio: add a line\n\nA stock voice speaks the line (ElevenLabs v4), then it goes into a clip one of two ways, as in the app's Finishing panel.\n\n**Lip sync (middle row).** sync.so's Sync-3 moves the mouth of a finished clip to the line. The longer of the two is cut to the shorter, the app's setting. Put the clip in as `walt-looks-up.mp4` (in `public/samples/`).\n\n**A new speaking clip (bottom row).** MiniMax H3 takes the cast's references plus the line as reference audio, and the prompt asks the speaker's lips to follow it. Put a character's sheet and front view in `ComfyUI/input/` as `walt-sheet.jpg` and `walt-front.jpg`: unzip any `.portraius` file, they're `sheet/turnaround.png` and `sheet/front.png`. The samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`. Set H3's duration to the line's length plus a second (4 to 15 s).\n\nThe app sends the line to ElevenLabs' dialogue endpoint; the node uses text to speech with the same model and voice. Needs a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Portraius Studio: add a line\n\nA stock voice speaks the line (ElevenLabs v4), then it goes into a clip one of two ways, as in the app's Finishing panel.\n\n**Lip sync (middle row).** sync.so's Sync-3 moves the mouth of a finished clip to the line. The longer of the two is cut to the shorter, the app's setting. Put the clip in as `walt-looks-up.mp4` (in `public/samples/`).\n\n**A new speaking clip (bottom row).** MiniMax H3 takes the cast's references plus the line as reference audio, and the prompt asks the speaker's lips to follow it. Put a character's sheet and front view in `ComfyUI/input/` as `walt-sheet.jpg` and `walt-front.jpg`: unzip any `.portraius` file, they're `sheet/turnaround.png` and `sheet/front.png`. The samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`. Set H3's duration to the line's length plus a second (4 to 15 s).\n\nThe app sends the line to ElevenLabs' dialogue endpoint; the node uses text to speech with the same model and voice. Needs a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      }
